1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,460
Close your left eye,

2
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,550
stare at the X,

3
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:03,900
and bring your phone

4
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,875
closer.

5
00:00:04,875 --> 00:00:06,850
The dot vanished?

6
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:08,811
Your eye has a HOLE

7
00:00:08,811 --> 00:00:09,800
in it.

8
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:10,589
That's where the cable

9
00:00:10,589 --> 00:00:12,194
to your brain plugs in...

10
00:00:12,194 --> 00:00:14,131
no room for light sensors.

11
00:00:14,131 --> 00:00:16,060
So the dot landed...

12
00:00:16,211 --> 00:00:17,600
on nobody.

13
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:18,730
And you didn't see a hole

14
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:19,510
there...

15
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:20,350
because your brain

16
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,114
paints over it

17
00:00:21,114 --> 00:00:22,867
with whatever's around it.

18
00:00:22,904 --> 00:00:24,220
An octopus?

19
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,234
Its eye is wired

20
00:00:25,234 --> 00:00:26,455
from behind...

21
00:00:26,455 --> 00:00:28,267
no hole at all.

22
00:00:29,127 --> 00:00:30,290
Show-off.

